OL,3,GNEWSADog posthumous award for saving
OL,4,Alives in gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog prevented a potentially deadly
OL,7,Fincident after waking up his sleeping
OL,8,Fowners to alert them they had left the
OL,9,Fgas on.
OL,11,FAustralian terrier Rio, from
OL,12,FHarrington, near Workington, Cumbria,
OL,13,Fbarked and took his owner down to the
OL,14,Fkitchen where one of the cooker's rings
OL,15,Fhad been accidently left on without a
OL,16,Fflame, allowing gas to escape.
OL,18,F"Without Rio, we would have slept
OL,19,Fthrough the night completely unaware of
OL,20,Fthe gas leak," owner Alison Tams said.
OL,21,F"We owe him everything."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
